{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat in Prague is oppressive today, but I found relief in the coolness of the old churches and galleries. I spent the morning revisiting the galleries, finding a certain quiet dignity in the old masters that contrasts sharply with the bustle of the city. At midday, I lunched with my host’s family. They are charming, though the conversation drifted from politics to the absurdity of the local theater.\n\nIn the afternoon, we took the carriage to the pleasure ground outside the town. The air was fresher there, and I watched the families strolling with a detached amusement. It is a spectacle of modern leisure, yet one cannot help but see the underlying structure of social habit in every smile and gesture. I shall dine with them again tomorrow before I continue my journey.\n\nDo not worry for me. I am well, if somewhat tired by the sun. I think of you and the boys constantly.\n\nYour loving husband,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080484,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":203,"prompt_tokens":940,"total_tokens":1143,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-lebFCJspI57D30rSwXsJeSfIqhRV63XS","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":940,"prompt_ms":940.441,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0004691489361703,"prompt_per_second":999.5310710613426,"predicted_n":203,"predicted_ms":4825.865,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.890420792079208,"predicted_per_second":41.85778093668182}}